        "original_id": "76d64b39-4854-5ee7-95ac-3a9e1e68e7b3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Travis Oates, Jim Cummings, Jason Scott Lee, Stephen Sommers, Edward S. Feldman, Raju Patel, Ronald Yanover, Mark Geldman\n- Companies: Walt Disney Animation Studios, Walt Disney Pictures, Disney\n- Films: Winnie the Pooh (2011 film), The Jungle Book (1994 film)\n\nFacts:\n- Rudyard Kipling's The Jungle Book is a 1994 American live-action adventure film.\n- Stephen Sommers co-wrote and directed Rudyard Kipling's The Jungle Book.\n- Edward S. Feldman and Raju Patel produced Rudyard Kipling's The Jungle Book from a story by Ronald Yanover and Mark Geldman.\n- Jason Scott Lee played Mowgli in Disney's 1994 live-action adaptation of The Jungle Book.\n- Winnie the Pooh is a 2011 American animated buddy musical comedy film.\n- Walt Disney Animation Studios produced Winnie the Pooh, and Walt Disney Pictures released it.\n- Travis Oates and Jim Cummings were the only two original voice actors to return for the 2011 Winnie the Pooh movie.",
